        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "df43246f-d51a-3693-90ec-fabbb98c4e09",
                "word": "katzwijm",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c4305583-78b3-3b6c-a6df-e1b57e13a415",
                        "entry_id": "df43246f-d51a-3693-90ec-fabbb98c4e09",
                        "glosses": [
                            "bewusteloosheid die maar kort duurt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "15ede9e9-6796-4807-8ece-5cff7e8d824b",
                                "sense_id": "c4305583-78b3-3b6c-a6df-e1b57e13a415",
                                "text": "Een (gepeilde) verviervoudiging van het aantal zetels, volle concertzalen, meisjes in katzwijm, de bijnaam de Jessias en internationale aandacht alsof hij het enige antwoord op Wilders is. GroenLinks is vanaf morgen waarschijnlijk de grootste partij op links en in één klap weer relevant in Den Haag. Klaver zegt premier te willen worden, maar velen in zijn partij hadden zelfs dit succes nauwelijks voor mogelijk gehouden."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3ae06265-b660-311d-931d-e70e105e2f4f",
                        "entry_id": "df43246f-d51a-3693-90ec-fabbb98c4e09",
                        "glosses": [
                            "door overmatige bewondering voor iemand niet meer kritisch kunnen denken"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2abc865f-7d45-4298-8461-00561d38cf80",
                                "sense_id": "3ae06265-b660-311d-931d-e70e105e2f4f",
                                "text": "Jimmy Breslin, de onlangs gestorven columnist uit New York over wie ik gisteren schreef, was als criticus van Donald Trump zijn tijd ver vooruit. Toen de media nog in katzwijm lagen van ontzag voor de zakenman Trump, schreef Breslin al woedende columns tegen hem. „Hij is de beste bluffer van zijn tijd”, concludeerde hij in een column uit 1988 (!) in de krant Newsday."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c44fe399-7865-4d87-8ebd-7edf7e8c6e80",
                        "source_entry_id": "df43246f-d51a-3693-90ec-fabbb98c4e09",
                        "source_sense_id": "c4305583-78b3-3b6c-a6df-e1b57e13a415",
                        "source_sense_description": "een bewusteloosheid die maar kort duurt",
                        "target_lang_word": "swoon",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "swoon",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba257899-d0d8-384f-9158-f62ab427f3f1",
                                        "entry_id": "26d497b3-9ec7-33aa-8fc7-bbbba60ca296",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A faint."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd1d34d5-ee49-42a3-976b-7894efd0e043",
                                                "sense_id": "ba257899-d0d8-384f-9158-f62ab427f3f1",
                                                "text": "She dandled it, and dancet it up and doune, / Not ceasing till she rais'd it from his swoune."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0a931cd-885b-4e15-8483-c9e6e2b00541",
                                                "sense_id": "ba257899-d0d8-384f-9158-f62ab427f3f1",
                                                "text": "\"I felt my strength fading away, and I was in a half swoon. How long this horrible thing lasted I know not, but it seemed that a long time must have passed before he took his foul, awful, sneering mouth away. I saw it drip with the fresh blood!\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96972628-ae1b-4684-91ec-e7ec47ec14d1",
                                                "sense_id": "ba257899-d0d8-384f-9158-f62ab427f3f1",
                                                "text": "As he drew near the throne, a rushing whirlwind arose in the corner of the hall and, lo! from the roof beams floated down a monstrous black serpent that coiled itself up on the very seat of majesty. The Emperor fell in a swoon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2cc42a19-156b-3175-b350-656035fc31c6",
                                        "entry_id": "26d497b3-9ec7-33aa-8fc7-bbbba60ca296",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An infatuation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "swoon",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "333fb089-4f7a-3237-908f-794897f6b8ed",
                                        "entry_id": "96664ad2-d7a9-3d76-acb5-714ede7a0306",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To faint, to lose consciousness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "literally"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7cac302-10cf-486d-ab12-c3f9b0fa9c91",
                                                "sense_id": "333fb089-4f7a-3237-908f-794897f6b8ed",
                                                "text": "I threw myself down on the island ground, like a dead man, and drowned in desolation swooned away, nor did I return to my senses till next morning, when the sun rose and revived me."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c69c2aa-e429-4efc-8f0e-81d57aa92608",
                                                "sense_id": "333fb089-4f7a-3237-908f-794897f6b8ed",
                                                "text": "I dropped the vessel quickly to a lower level. Nor was I a moment too soon. The girl had swooned."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec12c145-385c-4652-bd26-e52cc1f22719",
                                                "sense_id": "333fb089-4f7a-3237-908f-794897f6b8ed",
                                                "text": "He's got more than just mad skill / He's got a beaver tail and a bill. / And the women swoon whenever they hear him say…"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8fd1ba7c-3b3c-3fa0-bfea-cb8fceee4131",
                                        "entry_id": "96664ad2-d7a9-3d76-acb5-714ede7a0306",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be overwhelmed by emotion, especially infatuation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d236d5c1-5fd0-3970-9cd7-545dcf1f762f",
                                        "entry_id": "96664ad2-d7a9-3d76-acb5-714ede7a0306",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To overwhelm with emotion, especially infatuation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60300ff1-d76c-4c1f-8b12-7288aa762a07",
                                                "sense_id": "d236d5c1-5fd0-3970-9cd7-545dcf1f762f",
                                                "text": "That plush mustache of yours has completely swooned me!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "85c40539-2cd0-3efd-8444-931a045d0a31",
                                        "entry_id": "96664ad2-d7a9-3d76-acb5-714ede7a0306",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make a moan, sigh, or some other sound expressing infatuation or affection."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c19e046d-3e61-4366-a842-a87b821ebc7d",
                                                "sense_id": "85c40539-2cd0-3efd-8444-931a045d0a31",
                                                "text": "The girls swooned at the picture of their favorite actor."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca5ca85c-4dc0-4e0c-ae0e-60eb0fa9fd26",
                                                "sense_id": "85c40539-2cd0-3efd-8444-931a045d0a31",
                                                "text": "2013 (November 2), Pinky, 10 minutes into episode 25 (\"The Spy Who Slimed Me\") of TV series \"Pac-Man and the Ghostly Adventures\" per closed captions\n[Swoons] For sure. He's totally dreamy. Uh--but my heart still belongs to you, Pac-ums."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5e028fae-baec-48a6-a957-4113db43ccb4",
                        "source_entry_id": "df43246f-d51a-3693-90ec-fabbb98c4e09",
                        "source_sense_id": "c4305583-78b3-3b6c-a6df-e1b57e13a415",
                        "source_sense_description": "een bewusteloosheid die maar kort duurt",
                        "target_lang_word": "pâmoison",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pâmoison",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a963426-8d37-3900-b386-076adfbf6994",
                                        "entry_id": "37eef94c-c8dd-3a7c-8bc2-6164ca88ed12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action de se pâmer, évanouissement, syncope."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12cccc99-e7af-4e36-9dc8-1079ab844a9f",
                                                "sense_id": "1a963426-8d37-3900-b386-076adfbf6994",
                                                "text": "— Il n’est pas tombé sur le nez, dit sentencieusement Jacquemin Lampourde, ce n’est qu’une pâmoison ; il en peut réchapper encore."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "228c9635-53a7-4a6b-afe4-36243dee3536",
                                                "sense_id": "1a963426-8d37-3900-b386-076adfbf6994",
                                                "text": "Deux jours plus tard, elle eut la force de descendre seule au salon, repoussant tout appui, quoiqu’une sueur de défaillance perlât sur son front à peau mince, et que de petites pâmoisons la fissent tressaillir à chaque pas."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2586d779-de63-4ae4-a497-c297131baa0b",
                                                "sense_id": "1a963426-8d37-3900-b386-076adfbf6994",
                                                "text": "Plus de vingt fois, je recommençai la lettre, m’emportant, pleurant, tour à tour furieux jusqu’au délire, attendri jusqu’à la pâmoison…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34ab4e50-faff-4eed-b767-72cc48b76835",
                                                "sense_id": "1a963426-8d37-3900-b386-076adfbf6994",
                                                "text": "Les musiciens tirèrent de leurs instruments un air brutal et voluptueux qui, aussitôt, pénétra l’assistance d’une fiévreuse pâmoison."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79874e9f-1b00-4cc9-bf2d-8adb21de9c72",
                                                "sense_id": "1a963426-8d37-3900-b386-076adfbf6994",
                                                "text": "Elle se passa les doigts sur les paupières, les yeux reprirent une expression humaine comme si elle revenait d’une pâmoison."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "10f8da18-be63-37b7-b575-86444c69b4ed",
                                        "entry_id": "37eef94c-c8dd-3a7c-8bc2-6164ca88ed12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "État de bien-être que l’on ressent d’une sensation ou d’une émotion intense."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b8a9084-9a09-4ac0-8d2a-70b3e004b1ff",
                                                "sense_id": "10f8da18-be63-37b7-b575-86444c69b4ed",
                                                "text": "Elle devine comment faire jaillir le plaisir des beaux corps qui se présentent. Habile et douce, attentive, experte et souple, elle est partout à la fois, fabriquant de la pâmoison comme le pressoir fait de l’huile."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48bc7c06-b97f-4e12-8c1e-5918c67183e3",
                                                "sense_id": "10f8da18-be63-37b7-b575-86444c69b4ed",
                                                "text": "Un halètement rauque, régulier et comme tiré des entrailles par un tourment bienheureux se liait à une plainte longue, fêlée, filée, qui, bien qu’humaine, ressemblait au cri des bêtes en pâmoison."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "654c3763-a3e8-4453-9152-50fc7cf5f417",
                                                "sense_id": "10f8da18-be63-37b7-b575-86444c69b4ed",
                                                "text": "Le nouveau président est présenté comme l’incarnation du bien et fait l’objet d’une couverture dithyrambique par ses fans en pâmoison."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
